OL,5,G0100 Klimt & The Kiss
OL,6,     FExperts examine 'The Kiss' -
OL,7,     FGustav Klimt's iconic painting
OL,8,     Ffrom the early 20th century - and
OL,9,     Festablish just what makes it such
OL,10,     Fan enduring, endearing piece.
OL,11,G0215 Inside Art: Barbara Hepworth
OL,12,     FTo celebrate its 10th anniversary,
OL,13,     FKate Bryan explores a vast
OL,14,     Fcollection of work at The Hepworth
OL,15,     FWakefield by its namesake -
OL,16,     Fsculptor, Barbara Hepworth.
